BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 739.89 Tm (23. Final Advice) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 693.89 Tm (Build this as a product platform, not a collection of AI prompts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 659.89 Tm (The database should be the memory layer. The AI should be a service that reads from) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 644.89 Tm (that memory layer. The dashboard should visualize progress over time. The roadmap) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 629.89 Tm (should update from user behavior. The chat should be personalized from stored state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 595.89 Tm (That is what turns Mentor AI from a demo into a production system.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
